加一组**：上传 **首帧**（必传）、**尾帧**（可选；空=图生视频）\n3. 可添加多组；每组时长独立，总时长=各组之和\n4. 正向提示词写中间运动过程 → Queue Prompt\n\n帧数会按 17k+5 网格对齐（如 124）。\n\n## 档位：DiT 与文本编码器**成对**切换（`tools/switch-h3-weights.py`）\n- `baseline` = pruned int8 DiT + `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq` 文本编码器\n- `upgraded` = 未剪枝 int8 DiT + `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot` 文本编码器\n⚠️ **本机只该用 upgraded**：nvfp4 需要 Blackwell，本机 A5000 是 SM 8.6\n（`supports_nvfp4_compute` 为假）—— 选 baseline 不报错，只是拿不到 TensorCore 加速。\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## MiniMax H3 Director — 首尾帧 (fl2v)\n\n1. 加载与 t2v 相同的 fl2va UNET / CLIP / VAE\n2. 在导演台点 **添加一组**：上传 **首帧**（必传）、**尾帧**（可选；空=图生视频）\n3. 可添加多组；每组时长独立，总时长=各组之和\n4. 正向提示词写中间运动过程 → Queue Prompt\n\n帧数会按 17k+5 网格对齐（如 124）。\n\n## 档位：DiT 与文本编码器**成对**切换（`tools/switch-h3-weights.py`）\n- `baseline` = pruned int8 DiT + `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq` 文本编码器\n- `upgraded` = 未剪枝 int8 DiT + `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot` 文本编码器\n⚠️ **本机只该用 upgraded**：nvfp4 需要 Blackwell，本机 A5000 是 SM 8.6\n（`supports_nvfp4_compute` 为假）—— 选 baseline 不报错，只是拿不到 TensorCore 加速。\n"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":12,"type":"LoraLoaderModelOnly","pos":[0,160],"size":[360,82],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":1},{"localized_name":"LoRA名称","name":"lora_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"模型强度","name":"strength_model","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_model"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[12]}],"title":"H3 Turbo LoRA (8-step)","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"LoraLoaderModelOnly"},"widgets_values":["minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors",1],"widgets_values_named":{"lora_name":"minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors","strength_model":1}},{"id":13,"type":"BlockSparseAttention","pos":[-720,1020],"size":[400,250],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localize